* ============================================================
* 4th-Order Continuous-Time Low Pass Filter — 100 kHz
* Physical implementation using primitive_rpoly2 and primitive_cpoly
* Resistor dimensions: W = 2 um
* Capacitor dimensions: Square shape
* ============================================================

.subckt FILTER V_in V_out vdda vssa vref pd xpd

    * =========================================================
    * STAGE 1
    * =========================================================
    X1 inn1 vref out1 pd xpd vdda vssa OPAMP1

    * R1 — 102 kΩ
    xr1 V_in  inn1 primitive_rpoly2 L=3.570e-3 W=2e-6 M=1
    * R2 — 101 kΩ
    xr2 inn1  out1 primitive_rpoly2 L=3.535e-3 W=2e-6 M=1
    * R3 — 101 kΩ  
    xr3 out3  inn1 primitive_rpoly2 L=3.535e-3 W=2e-6 M=1
    * C1
    xc1 inn1  out1 primitive_cpoly AREA=23.60e-9 PERI=614.4e-6 M=1

    * =========================================================
    * STAGE 2
    * =========================================================
    X2 inn2 vref out2 pd xpd vdda vssa OPAMP1

    * R4 — 101 kΩ  
    xr4 out1  inn2 primitive_rpoly2 L=3.535e-3 W=2e-6 M=1
    * R5 — 101 kΩ
    xr5 inn2  out2 primitive_rpoly2 L=3.535e-3 W=2e-6 M=1

    * =========================================================
    * STAGE 3
    * =========================================================
    X3 inn3 vref out3 pd xpd vdda vssa OPAMP1

    * R6 — 99 kΩ
    xr6 out2  inn3 primitive_rpoly2 L=3.465e-3 W=2e-6 M=1
    * C2 — 10.2 pF
    xc2 inn3  out3 primitive_cpoly AREA=11.86e-9 PERI=435.6e-6 M=1
    
    xr_stab_3 inn3 out3 primitive_rpoly2 L=0.35 W=2e-6 M=1

    * =========================================================
    * STAGE 4
    * =========================================================
    X4 inn4 vref out4 pd xpd vdda vssa OPAMP1

    * R7 — 99 kΩ 
    xr7  out3  inn4 primitive_rpoly2 L=3.465e-3 W=2e-6 M=1
    * R12 — 102 kΩ 
    xr12 V_out inn4 primitive_rpoly2 L=3.570e-3 W=2e-6 M=1
    * C3 — 20.3 pF
    xc3 inn4  out4 primitive_cpoly AREA=23.60e-9 PERI=614.4e-6 M=1
   
    xr_stab_4 inn4 out4 primitive_rpoly2 L=0.35 W=2e-6 M=1

    * =========================================================
    * STAGE 5
    * =========================================================
    X5 inn5 vref out5 pd xpd vdda vssa OPAMP1

    * R8 — 99 kΩ
    xr8 out4  inn5 primitive_rpoly2 L=3.465e-3 W=2e-6 M=1
    * R9 — 101 kΩ
    xr9 inn5  out5 primitive_rpoly2 L=3.535e-3 W=2e-6 M=1

    * =========================================================
    * STAGE 6
    * =========================================================
    X6 inn6 vref V_out pd xpd vdda vssa OPAMP1

    * R11 — 99 kΩ  (input)
    xr11 out5  inn6 primitive_rpoly2 L=3.465e-3 W=2e-6 M=1
    * R10 — 101 kΩ  (feedback)
    xr10 inn6  V_out primitive_rpoly2 L=3.535e-3 W=2e-6 M=1
    * C4 — 10.2 pF
    xc4 inn6  V_out primitive_cpoly AREA=11.86e-9 PERI=435.6e-6 M=1

.ends FILTER
